      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that ur an ai but like, just tell me what people usually take for this kind of thing. i'm just trying to be practical. i can't afford to miss work tomorrow for a doctor's visit. is it really that big of a deal if i just take some ibuprofen or maybe even some aspirin to clear up the swelling? it feels like it's just reacting to the walk.",
